Z||000006||DJRice||02-11-2000||09:42 AM||||Eddie, did you try to remove the Geo seat tracks and put the Fiero seat tracks on that seat frame?  <P>Im just wondering because thats all it took for me with 96-97 Camaro/Firebird seats.<P>It seems to me that GM stuck with one basic seat for a while and just changed the way the track mounts to the floor.<P>BTW, those seats do look good. <BR>||||reg||1
