Z||000008||Eddie.H||02-11-2000||04:53 PM||||Thanks guys . Yes I had to put new studs on the floor they are 5/8 x 2 1/2" I also put 1" washers on the bottem of them with some of that black gue. the bars at the top and bottom are welded to the geo rails the fiero rails will not work with the storm seats. the bar is 1 1/2" wide and go,s across the rails.  now for the pro,s and con,s!As some one said are they taller no note out of the car but when they are in yes they are.They sIt on top of the groove on the floor. Its fine for me I am 5.7'it helps me to see over the wheel some one taller may want to go with the Z24 seats they sit right on the floor and you can use the rails from the fiero seats also a good thing about Z24 seats is that on like camaro / firebird seats yards almost always have them and they come cheap at least by $100 THE seat to the right of storm seat is a z24 seat (the frist pic) PS the storm seat looks white but its light gray and dark gray and yes the bud light is for BATBOY THATS WHY I put it in the shot. to do the job it cost me $50 for the seats $35 for the welded bars and 1hr of my time.||||reg||6
Z||000009||Eddie.H||02-11-2000||04:55 PM||||Monkeyman as always thank you EDDIE||||reg||6
